{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Retry the initial existence probe too**\n\nThis retries `GetFunctionConfiguration`, but the preceding `checkFunctionExists()` still issues an unprotected `GetFunctionCommand`. A throttling rejection there exits deployment before any new retry phase, leaving the control-plane failure mode unresolved. Wrap that probe in `retryOnConflict` and add a unit case that throttles `GetFunctionCommand`.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs745rbZ","finding_digest":"20ecb498ac00a5b27e03a2adb60e6321e4487af848b74d1037fbac9128f5c19f","finding_id":"arf_v1_edwljgfmacs3e7qdukw3mdtdeh","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/deploy-lambda.ts::initial-reconciliation::unretried-existence-probe","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/deploy-lambda.ts::initial-reconciliation::unretried-existence-probe","line":703,"observation_digest":"4b7dd01c205a4ab244a890e52c72e5028579652acc19cd67f5852ef566b241c8","observation_id":"aro_v1_jn65ahbaljflerfisdssy4xfak","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-examples/scripts/deploy-lambda.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-04T02:40:33Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ugldfoxebe3lneh5mfvobtkr6z","reviewed_base_sha":"cc7db9bacb23278c58aecf16821737ba47797152","reviewed_head_sha":"1895cf2ee00117dda0882e070eaa6cdc39ee64f4","reviewer":"codex","start_line":700,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":959},"record_id":"art_v1_gvb4nousfh6oh375negebe6rbi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-04T02:40:33Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
